{"content":[{"c":["MADON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the many Canaanite cities allied against Joshua in a vain attempt to stop the progress of the Israelites into Palestine. A disastrous battle fought at Meron brought these cities under Israelite control (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.11.1","r":"Josh.11.1","rawR":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.11.1","value":"Josh.11.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 11:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.19","r":"Josh.12.19","rawR":"Josh.12.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.19","value":"Josh.12.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:19"},"). Madon is probably the modern Qarn Hattin, about five miles (8 kilometers) from the Sea of Galilee."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Madon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 11:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.11.1","rawQueryValue":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefExact":"Josh.11.1"},{"anchorText":"12:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.19","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.19","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4baecf4e6f3b17eb0cc1155c01353de0e9d3b61242ab74e9e548a40f7f07a43d","sourceItemName":"Madon","sourceItemOrder":39,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Madon","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Madon","title":"Madon","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}